	(text "U601: ENA=3.3 V, INA=HEATER_EN. Channel B disabled. VDD = +12V from the aux buck (sheet 06).\nC601/C602 close to VDD/GND. Short OUTA-G-S-GND loop.\nMCU R210=10k pull-down; R602 discharges the gate."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0239c72d-4d5d-5a05-a140-27900a5edf6a")
	)
	(text "PTC: низкочастотное ON/OFF. Внешний термостат/термопредохранитель\nпоследовательно с +PTC, с DC-рейтингом по току; температуру выбрать\nпо механике нагревателя. На этой схеме он НЕ установлен.\nTVS — от выбросов на проводах, не защита от КЗ. Ветвь защищена F902; отключение при КЗ требует проверки."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4dbbc201-19dd-5f83-b070-097451d8c59e")
	)
	(text "PTC / 24 V / 100 W / 4.17 A, ПУСК ~4.8 A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82bb9dd5-212e-5170-a51a-f347edc95d74")
	)
	(text "Q601: G=4, S=1/2/3, D=5; SO-8FL exposed drain is not GND.\nRDS(on) max 2.4 mOhm at VGS=10 V, 25 C; gate now ~12 V.\nConduction ~0.042 W at 4.17 A / ~0.055 W at 4.8 A (25 C).\nD601 SMBJ30A: standoff 30 V > 25 V supply, clamp 48.4 V < 60 V VDS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b265a6f5-dfce-5b57-8983-a5f2e930067d")
	)
	(text "0.22 DRAFT: 24 V / 100 W PTC; power/thermal limits require prototype validation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c2aa5ada-8f3c-5716-9467-86d1bb049840")
	)
